# Environment variables for apps/frontend
#
# No database URL — D1 is a Worker binding declared in wrangler.jsonc, not a secret.
#
# Secrets (BETTER_AUTH_SECRET, RESEND_API_KEY) go in .dev.vars (local) or
# `wrangler secret put` (production) — never committed.
#
# NEVER commit .env or .dev.vars — they hold live credentials. Only this file is tracked.
